  "description": "Orion Vortex is an explosive, high-energy Graffiti Font designed to capture the raw, rebellious spirit of street art and urban culture.\nThis bold display typeface features chunky, rounded bubble letters with dynamic drips and outlines, giving your text an immediate, eye-catching three-dimensional effect.\nThe Orion Vortex typeface is the perfect solution for designs that need to convey attitude, movement, and a distinctive street vibe, such as gaming titles, hip-hop album covers, extreme sports promotions, or contemporary apparel branding. The unique styling, including the characteristic liquid drips, ensures that this Graffiti Font stands out from the crowd and delivers maximum impact. Use the Orion Vortex font to make a loud, unforgettable statement in any creative project.\nThe font is also PUA-encoded, ensuring effortless access to all glyphs, swashes, and alternate characters to help you customize your creations with ease.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Orion Vortex is an explosive, high-energy Graffiti Font designed to capture the raw, rebellious spirit of street art and urban culture.</strong></p>\n<p>This bold display typeface features chunky, rounded bubble letters with dynamic drips and outlines, giving your text an immediate, eye-catching three-dimensional effect.</p>\n<p>The Orion Vortex typeface is the perfect solution for designs that need to convey attitude, movement, and a distinctive street vibe, such as gaming titles, hip-hop album covers, extreme sports promotions, or contemporary apparel branding. The unique styling, including the characteristic liquid drips, ensures that this Graffiti Font stands out from the crowd and delivers maximum impact. Use the Orion Vortex font to make a loud, unforgettable statement in any creative project.</p>\n<p>The font is also PUA-encoded, ensuring effortless access to all glyphs, swashes, and alternate characters to help you customize your creations with ease.</p>",
